# Send only MVC source to the build context.
# Docker (2026): https://docs.docker.com/build/concepts/context/#dockerignore-files
# Accessed: 19 November 2026.
**
!src/
!src/RaceDay.Web/
!src/RaceDay.Web/**

# Keep local output and private settings out of every stage.
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/.vs/
**/*.user
**/*.suo
**/secrets.json
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/.secrets
**/*.pfx
**/*.p12
**/*.pem
**/*.key
